  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br><br>Private Heated Pool • Steps to the Beach • Blue Mountain Beach<br><br>ABOUT THE HOME<br>Welcome to Skinny Love 30A, a stunning coastal retreat just steps from the sugar-white sand and turquoise waters of the Emerald Coast. Perfectly positioned south of 30A, this beautifully remodeled home blends relaxed beach charm with upscale comfort—creating the ideal setting for multi-family vacations, reunions, retreats, and memory-making gatherings.<br><br>From the moment you arrive, Skinny Love 30A invites you to slow down and savor the magic of 30A living. Thoughtfully designed and beautifully decorated, this four-bedroom, four-and-a-half-bath home offers both cozy gathering spaces and private retreats so everyone in your group can relax in style.<br><br>The heart of the home is the gourmet kitchen and open living space, where the oversized island and seating invite family breakfasts, evening cocktails, and lively conversations after a day at the beach. Whether you're cooking together, playing games, or sharing stories about the day's adventures, the layout was designed to bring people together effortlessly.<br><br>Step outside and discover your own private pool oasis, the perfect place to cool off after a beach day or unwind with a sunset swim. The outdoor patio and seating area create a welcoming space for grilling, relaxing, and enjoying warm Gulf breezes with friends and family.<br><br>With a master suite on the main floor and additional spacious bedrooms upstairs, the home comfortably accommodates groups while offering privacy for everyone. Kids will love the fun bunk spaces, while adults will appreciate the stylish design and comfortable retreat after a full day of sun and sand.<br><br>And the location couldn’t be more perfect. Skinny Love 30A sits directly across from the famous Blue Mountain Creamery, meaning ice cream treats are only steps away. Pair that with the beach just down the street and your private pool waiting back at home, and you have the ultimate recipe for a 30A vacation that guests return to year after year.<br><br>ABOUT THE AREA<br>Blue Mountain Beach is one of the most beloved communities along Scenic Highway 30A, known for its laid-back charm, natural beauty, and welcoming family atmosphere. Nestled between Santa Rosa Beach and Grayton Beach State Park, the area offers pristine beaches, scenic walking and biking trails, and some of the best local restaurants along the coast.<br><br>Start your morning with coffee and pastries from Blue Mountain Bakery, spend the afternoon exploring nearby beaches or biking the Timpoochee Trail, and end the day with dinner at Blue Mabel before grabbing ice cream just steps from your front door.<br><br>To make exploring even easier, Skinny Love 30A includes four bikes and a six-seater golf cart, allowing you to cruise to nearby shops, restaurants, and beach accesses with ease.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS<br>The Blue Mountain Regional Beach Access is less than a block away, making it incredibly easy to go from breakfast to beach in minutes. This access includes restrooms, showers, and plenty of space to enjoy the beautiful white sand beaches. Coolers, wagons, kayaks, paddleboards, and single inflatable toys are permitted.<br><br>ACCOMMODATIONS<br>Sleeps 12<br><br>• Bedroom 1 – King Master with ensuite bath and custom Murphy bed (1st Floor)<br>• Bedroom 2 – King Master with ensuite bath (2nd Floor)<br>• Bedroom 3 – King Trundle with Twin Bunk and ensuite bath (2nd Floor)<br>• Bedroom 4 – Bunk Room with Queen/Queen and Twin/Twin/Twin, ensuite bath (2nd Floor)<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS<br>• Private Heated Pool (heating available upon request for an additional fee)<br>• Located South of 30A<br>• Less than a block to beach access<br>• 4 Adult Bikes Included<br>• 6-Seater Golf Cart<br>• Gourmet Kitchen with Large Island and Seating<br>• Outdoor Patio with Seating<br>• Propane Grill<br>• Master Suite on Main Floor<br>• Full-Size Washer & Dryer<br>• Spacious Pantry<br>• TVs Throughout the Home<br>• Fully Stocked Kitchen<br>• Full Linen Package – bedding and bath<br><br>PARKING<br>Two parking spaces are available in front of the home with overflow parking on S Co Hwy 83.<br><br>HOUSE RULES<br>• Check-In: After 4 PM | Check-Out: 10 AM<br>• No smoking or vaping<br>• Renters must be 25 years of age or older<br>• State and county taxes plus required fees apply<br>• Starter amenities are provided upon arrival<br><br>IMPORTANT PRIOR TO ARRIVAL<br>All guests will be required to sign a rental agreement directly with Bonheur Vacations and verify identity through the Happy Stays app by uploading:<br>A government-issued photo ID<br>A selfie for verification<br><br>ABOUT BONHEUR VACATIONS<br>Bonheur Vacations is a female-founded, locally family-owned boutique vacation management company dedicated to creating unforgettable stays along the beautiful Emerald Coast and Scenic Highway 30A.<br><br>We believe the best vacations happen when beautiful homes, thoughtful hospitality, and meaningful experiences come together. From relaxing family beach trips to milestone celebrations and group getaways, our team is passionate about helping guests create memories that last long after the sand washes away.<br><br>Our concierge team can assist with everything from private chefs and beach bonfires to massages, yoga sessions, childcare, celebration planning, and more.<br><br>When you choose Bonheur Vacations, you're choosing a local team that truly cares about every detail of your stay—so you can focus on what matters most: relaxing, reconnecting, and enjoying the magic of 30A.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Skinny Love 30A Luxury Home w Heated Pool, Golf Cart, Bikes, Steps to Beach"
        }
      ],
